    "evidence": "The headline and deployment decision clearly state the limitation: this is post-remediation regression evidence, not an independent holdout or production-readiness proof. However, the required next step appears only as small text (“preregister an independent family holdout”), with no actionable control. “Hide scope evidence” is ambiguous, the large vault graphic delays the results, and dense low-contrast microcopy makes the evidence difficult to scan—especially on mobile. The mobile header also does not visibly establish the current Vault location.",
